  "history_of_present_illness": "The patient is a 61\u2011year\u2011old woman with a long\u2011standing history of hypertension, obesity, metabolic syndrome and type 2 diabetes mellitus. Over two decades her renal disease progressed from CKD stage 1 (2000) to stage 4 (2017) with microalbuminuria (2005) and proteinuria (2007). She was placed on the kidney transplant waiting list in 2016 and remains awaiting transplantation. Comorbidities include hyperlipidemia, anemia, major depressive disorder, and ongoing drug misuse. Social factors such as limited social contact, housing instability, a criminal record and full\u2011time employment complicate adherence. The most recent documented encounter was in February 2019; no laboratory or vital\u2011sign data are available after that date.",
